Package: awapp
Version: 1.0.5
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: rodlessa <rodlessa@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.17)
Description: Dependency-free terminal weather visualizer
 A terminal weather visualizer that renders current conditions as a
 full-screen ANSI animation: sun/moon arcs, real star positions, seasonal
 leaves, rain, clouds and more. Keyless Open-Meteo by default; optional
 OpenWeatherMap key.
